      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        121.91059875488281,
        130.37139892578125,
        138.7666015625
      ],
      "text": "5.1 \t C",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130.5872039794922,
        125.91740417480469,
        235.6632537841797,
        137.7165985107422
      ],
      "text": "hapter objectives",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        146.45953369140625,
        513.4603881835938,
        159.81103515625
      ],
      "text": "This chapter describes approaches to prevention of TB in children as well as the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        162.4560546875,
        513.3798828125,
        175.80755615234375
      ],
      "text": "management of children living in families affected by TB; BCG vaccination, contact",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        178.45257568359375,
        325.9529113769531,
        191.8040771484375
      ],
      "text": "investigation and infection control are addressed.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        211.5225372314453,
        155.51539611816406,
        228.3785400390625
      ],
      "text": "5.2 \t BCG",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        155.73109436035156,
        215.5293426513672,
        226.8496856689453,
        227.3285369873047
      ],
      "text": "vaccination",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        236.00222778320312,
        513.4028930664062,
        249.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "Mycobacterium  Bacille Calmette-Guérin (BCG) is a live attenuated vaccine derived from",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        251.99874877929688,
        513.4949340820312,
        265.41925048828125
      ],
      "text": "bovis . For a number of reasons, the protective efficacy of BCG against TB varies widely",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        267.9952697753906,
        187.9298858642578,
        281.415771484375
      ],
      "text": "(1) between settings  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        295.2315979003906,
        278.3953857421875,
        309.45159912109375
      ],
      "text": "BCG in highly TB-endemic settings",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        320.49920654296875,
        213.58639526367188,
        334.126708984375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 15 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        344.25372314453125,
        513.2955932617188,
        359.58770751953125
      ],
      "text": "In settings where TB is highly endemic or where there is high risk of exposure",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        357.4537353515625,
        445.96453857421875,
        372.7877197265625
      ],
      "text": "to TB, a single dose of BCG vaccine should be given to all infants",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        382.9752197265625,
        397.16229248046875,
        396.32672119140625
      ],
      "text": "(Recommendation strength and evidence quality ungraded ) 1",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.8887939453125,
        407.7807312011719,
        513.4273071289062,
        421.1322326660156
      ],
      "text": "Source: Revised BCG vaccination guidelines for infants at risk for HIV infection.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.8887939453125,
        421.51171875,
        367.9063415527344,
        434.9322204589844
      ],
      "text": "Weekly Epidemiological Record  (2) , 2007, 82:193-196",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        443.5802307128906,
        513.3929443359375,
        456.9317321777344
      ],
      "text": "Neonatal BCG vaccination provides substantial protection against the more severe types",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        459.57672119140625,
        513.3699951171875,
        472.92822265625
      ],
      "text": "of disseminated TB, such as miliary TB and tuberculous meningitis, to which infants and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        475.50421142578125,
        312.09674072265625,
        488.9247131347656
      ],
      "text": "(3) young children are particularly susceptible  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        500.0797119140625,
        513.416015625,
        513.4312133789062
      ],
      "text": "There is no evidence that revaccination with BCG affords any additional protection, and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        516.0072631835938,
        320.6182861328125,
        529.427734375
      ],
      "text": "(4) revaccination is therefore not recommended  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        543.239501953125,
        156.37939453125,
        557.45947265625
      ],
      "text": "BCG and HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        568.5071411132812,
        213.58639526367188,
        582.1346435546875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 16 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        592.2615966796875,
        510.2374572753906,
        607.5955810546875
      ],
      "text": "In children who are known to be HIV-infected, BCG vaccine should not be given",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        617.7831420898438,
        397.16229248046875,
        631.1346435546875
      ],
      "text": "(Recommendation strength and evidence quality ungraded ) 1",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.8887939453125,
        642.588623046875,
        513.4273071289062,
        655.9401245117188
      ],
      "text": "Source: Revised BCG vaccination guidelines for infants at risk for HIV infection.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.8887939453125,
        656.3196411132812,
        367.9063415527344,
        669.7401123046875
      ],
      "text": "Weekly Epidemiological Record (2) , 2007, 82:193-196",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        767.9046020507812,
        512.4326171875,
        779.9046020507812
      ],
      "text": "The Global Advisory Committee on Vaccine Safety (GACVS) does not use the GRADE methodology for evaluating the  1",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21649932861328,
        777.5045776367188,
        395.9125061035156,
        789.5045776367188
      ],
      "text": "quality of evidence; the BCG-related recommendations will therefore remain ungraded.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "43",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
